  title: W I L D   W E S T
  button: SADDLE UP
  riddle: 'Pointed of toe and high of heel,

    I wear a star that spins like a
    wheel.

    I''ve walked the trail from dusk to dawn;

    grab both my loops
    and pull me on.'
  hint: A cowboy boot seen side-on, toe to the right, with a star spur on its heel.
  complete: 'YEEHAW

    Saddle up, partner.'
  accent: {r: 0.85, g: 0.55, b: 0.3, a: 1}
  lamps: 00000000
